  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c243b1514d37b41a1b778ccb37ce87a9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1 Light the bulb
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ARCircuitsLab.Tasks.TaskData
  title: Light the bulb
  goal: Connect a battery, a switch and a bulb in one loop. Then close the switch.
  hint: Wire battery + to the switch, the switch to the bulb, and the bulb back to
    battery -. Then tap the switch.
  goalType: 0
  points: 100
  parts:
  - 1 battery
  - 1 switch
  - 1 bulb
  - 3 wires
  learn: Current only flows when the path is a complete loop.
  successTitle: The bulb is on!
  explanation: "Closing the switch completed the loop, so current can flow. I = V
    \xF7 R = 3 V \xF7 12 \u03A9 \u2248 {0:0.00} A."
